Netflix Shows and Movies SQL Analysis
Project Overview

This project analyzes Netflix movies and TV shows using MySQL. It explores ratings, release years, genres, runtime, actors, and directors.

Tools Used
MySQL
MySQL Workbench
SQL
Database

Database name: shows_movies

Tables:

titles — information about movies and TV shows
credits — information about actors and directors
Key Analysis
Top and bottom titles based on IMDb ratings
Average IMDb and TMDB scores
Titles released by decade and year
Most common genres and age certifications
Actors and directors with the most appearances
Average runtime of movies and shows
Highly rated and popular movies
How to Run
Download or clone this repository.
Import the required CSV datasets into MySQL.
Create and select the shows_movies database.
Open Netflix_SQL_Analysis.sql in MySQL Workbench.
Run the queries to explore the results.
Note

The CSV datasets are required to run the analysis. Ensure that the table and column names match the SQL queries.
